  "Software Details": "Szczegóły oprogramowania",
  "Managing your digital products is easy with the eCommerceGo SaaS Digital Product Module. Whether you are a seasoned entrepreneur or just starting, our platform provides the tools you need to organize, showcase, and deliver your digital offerings efficiently. With our module, you can streamline your entire workflow, from adding products to delivering them to your customers.": "Zarządzanie produktami cyfrowymi jest łatwe dzięki modułowi produktów cyfrowych eCommerceGo SaaS. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Zobacz demonstrację na żywo",
  "User-Friendly Product Addition Process": "Przyjazny dla użytkownika proces dodawania produktu",
  "Adding digital products is simple with our intuitive interface. You can easily input all the relevant details for each product, including titles, descriptions, prices, and any additional information you wish to provide. This allows you to create informative product listings that effectively showcase the value of your digital offerings. Plus, our module supports the upload of attachments, like files or images, to complement your products and enhance the customer experience.": "Dodawanie produktów cyfrowych jest proste dzięki naszemu intuicyjnemu interfejsowi. ",
  "Enhanced Frontend Accessibility": "Ulepszona dostępność frontonu",
